# vib, the visual interface builder of the stock oracle (/home/resources/icon-stock-x/bin/vib), started on a new file:
# argument 1 app.icn
# Three objects are made by pressing a palette icon and dragging onto the canvas (a button, a label, a rectangle); the button's dialog is opened
# with the right button, its label typed over and its style set to check; the focused object is moved with the arrow keys; it is copied from the
# Edit menu; the canvas is made smaller by dragging its sizer; the interface is saved from the File menu into app.icn; quit from the File menu.
drag 1 25 43 150 150
wait
drag 1 408 43 300 150
wait
drag 1 360 43 150 250
wait
# the right button on the push button: its dialog, the label selected
click 3 155 155
wait
type Go
click 1 282 240
wait
key Return
wait
key Right
key Right
key Right
key Down
key Down
wait
# the Edit menu held open, then its item copy
move 65 11
press 1
wait
move 80 30
release 1
wait
# the sizer at the canvas corner dragged inward
drag 1 597 462 500 400
wait
# the File menu, item save
move 20 11
press 1
wait
move 30 60
release 1
wait
# the File menu, item quit
move 20 11
press 1
wait
move 30 120
release 1
